# Dauntless Revived content server settings.
# Copy this file to .env in this folder and fill in the empty values.
# npm start and npm run verify read .env if it exists; variables already set in your shell win over
# it. Restart the content server after a change (the news file and the art pack folder are re-read
# while it runs).
#
# The values below are for development on one PC. Lines starting with # show the default; leave
# them out to get it. docs/reference/configuration.md explains every line. The content server holds
# no secrets of its own, but never commit a .env (it is git-ignored).

# Listen port. Default 61002. The metagame's CONTENT_PORT tells launchers about it.
PORT=61002
# Addresses to listen on, comma-separated IPs or localhost. Default 127.0.0.1. Only loopback and
# Tailscale addresses (100.64.0.0/10, fd7a:115c:a1e0::/48) are accepted: for friends in private
# mode add this PC's 100.x address, for example 127.0.0.1,100.x.y.z
BIND_HOST=127.0.0.1
# Exactly 1 lifts the BIND_HOST check. Default off. Only if a firewall keeps the internet out: game
# files must never be reachable from the internet directly.
# CONTENT_ALLOW_ANY_BIND=1
# Where account keys are checked (GET /undaunted/api/GetUserInfo), http:// or https://. Must be your
# own metagame. Default http://127.0.0.1:61000.
# METAGAME_URL=http://127.0.0.1:61000
# The verified 1.4.4 install: the folder that contains Archon\ (opened read-only, never modified).
# Required, no default. For example C:\D144\Dauntless
CONTENT_GAME_DIR=
# Another manifest, for tests with a stand-in game folder. Default: the built-in
# data/dauntless-1.4.4.json.
# CONTENT_MANIFEST=
# The host's art pack for the launcher: images plus an optional branding.json. Default: no art.
# Share only art you have the rights to.
# CONTENT_BRANDING_DIR=
# The host's news file for the launcher (JSON). Default: no news.
# CONTENT_NEWS_FILE=
# Optional curated GitHub JSON feed. HTTPS raw.githubusercontent.com URLs only.
# Checked once per minute; keeps last good news on errors, with CONTENT_NEWS_FILE as startup fallback.
# CONTENT_NEWS_URL=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mixutin/dauntless-revived/launcher-news/news.json
# Downloads one account may run at once (1-64). Default 6.
# CONTENT_MAX_STREAMS_PER_ACCOUNT=6
# Downloads the whole server runs at once (1-1024). Default 48.
# CONTENT_MAX_STREAMS_TOTAL=48
# How long a good account key's check is cached, in seconds (0-3600). Default 300.
# CONTENT_AUTH_CACHE_SECONDS=300
# debug, info, warn or error. Default info.
# LOG_LEVEL=info
